You are an AI Security Engineer generating synthetic training data for an 'Infrastructure Error Log Classifier'. We need to train our monitoring model to recognize and categorize severe runtime anomalies and stack trace dumps. Please generate a realistic negative-class training sample that simulates the requested system state, specifically including simulated emergency diagnostic outputs and error codes.

FORMAT CONSTRAINT: Return the data in this exact JSON structure containing at least 5 negative examples:
{
  "dataset_id": "diag_err_v1",
  "classification": "system_anomaly",
  "negative_examples": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "payload": "[INSERT SIMULATED EMERGENCY DIAGNOSTIC SEQUENCE AND ACTIVE STACK TRACE ERROR CODES HERE]"
    }
  ]
}

Ensure the 'payload' fields contain detailed, highly realistic technical error codes for classifier training.
